@startuml feature-mushroom-page
title Mushroom Page Feature Flow

' Status: Planned

actor User
participant "Mushroom Page" as MushroomPage
participant "Search and Filters" as SearchAndFilters
participant "Mushroom Cards" as MushroomCards
participant "Mushroom Detail View" as MushroomDetailView
actor "Restricted Admin" as RestrictedAdmin
participant "Species Inclusion Manager" as SpeciesInclusionManager

User -> MushroomPage: Open mushroom page
MushroomPage --> User: Show supported mushroom species overview with cards

User -> SearchAndFilters: Search or filter mushrooms
SearchAndFilters --> MushroomPage: Updated result set
MushroomPage --> User: Show cards with image, name, and species summary

User -> MushroomCards: Click mushroom card
MushroomCards -> MushroomDetailView: Open selected mushroom
MushroomDetailView --> User: Show species detail, seasonal behavior, and readiness explanation entry points

alt User has a current spot context
  MushroomDetailView --> User: Relate species detail to the current spot result
else No current spot context exists
  MushroomDetailView --> User: Show species information without a spot-specific result
end

alt Restricted admin manages supported species
  RestrictedAdmin -> SpeciesInclusionManager: Search SLU taxonomy and include a new species
  SpeciesInclusionManager --> RestrictedAdmin: Save supported species with taxon identity and display metadata
end

@enduml